14. Conclusion
The Student Record System demonstrates how HTML, CSS and JavaScript can be combined to create a polished academic management application without a heavy software stack. The solution improves organization, reduces repetitive manual work and gives users immediate visibility into student attendance and performance. The architecture also provides a clear path toward a full-stack production system.
